      "content": "it's just hard to see how \"taking a step back\" helps when everything feels so heavy. it's not just about needing a break... it feels more like there's no place for me left in this version of reality. like the world has already finished with me. do you think things ever actually get better for people who feel like they don't belong anymore?",
